Carsten Wimmer <cawim@dungeon.fido.de> asks:

> 1)  I got a Crossbow...  Have I to use arrows too or is it enough
>      if I wield the Bow ?

> 2)  I wield a Sling. How can I put Rocks into the sling ?

All missile weapons in NetHack work the same.  To use your crossbow, wield
it ("w"), then throw ("t") crossbow bolts at the enemy.  To use the sling,
wield it, then throw rocks.

If you don't have the right ammunition, your crossbow or sling won't do you
any good.  On the other hand, you CAN throw rocks, darts, bolts, etc.
without having the weapon that launches them, but you won't throw as well.

> 3)  How can I kill a Shop-Keeper ? 8-)

Shopkeepers are pretty tough, but they don't have any really unique defenses
(that I know about, anyway).  It's probably not worth fighting them; just go
down to the next level.  A shopkeeper won't leave his floor.

> 4)  Someone spoke some Curses on me. After this I had a Black Bow instead
>      of a Crossbow, and some other strange changes !!!!!
>      How can I remove the curse ?

There are several ways.  Find a lawful altar and drop your cursed items there;
#pray (but not too often!), or find a scroll of remove curse (and hope it
isn't cursed itself!)  If you don't have an altar handy, you can use your pet
to see if your newfound items are cursed.  Set them down on the floor.  Your
dog or cat won't walk on them if they are cursed.

